      "text": "Ye concrete channel do kaam kar rha hai\n- subscribe/ unsubscriber/ notify ka kaam kar rha hai\n- upload vide get video\n\n\nso basically ye bussiness logic bhi handle r rha hai aur ye observer design pattern ka logic bhi handle kar rha hai",
